# `!`-move of a collection with a LIVE element borrow, then `w.clear()`.
# Pre-fix the deferred CollectionRef survived the move and the clear freed
# the element storage out from under `first` (empty-string read).
# Bind shape MUST be `.get(i).unwrap()` — `v[i]` is already-safe.
void main():
    Vector[String] v = ["alpha", "beta"]
    String first = v.get(0).unwrap()
    Vector[String] w = !v
    w.clear()
    print(first)
    print(w.len())
